.
.  Generate sample output for Binomial PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na binpdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Binomial PDF (N=100, P=0.3)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
LINE BLANK
SPIKE ON
XTIC OFFSET 1 1
.
PLOT BINPDF(X,0.3,100) FOR X = 0 1 100
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv BINPDF.PS binpdf.ps
.
quit
